Example YANG snippet:
```yang
module example-actions {
  namespace "urn:example:actions";
  prefix ex;

  rpc start-trace {
    input {
      leaf filter {
        type string;
      }
    }
    action "trace-start" {
      input {
        leaf duration {
          type uint32;
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
Here, the `action` `trace-start` is invoked within the `start-trace` RPC, allowing dynamic parameterization (e.g., duration) while maintaining NETCONF’s RPC structure.

