        AdvOnLink on;
        AdvAutonomous on;
        AdvRouterAddr on;
        AdvManagedFlag off;
        AdvOtherConfigFlag on;
    };
};
```
Then enable **Stateless DHCPv6** on the DHCPv6 server (e.g., `isc-dhcp-server`) to relay DNS and other options via **IA_NA (Information-Only Address)**.

