```yang
module my-module {
    uses my-base:base-config {
        refine "my-base:leaf1" {
            config false;
            default "default-value";
        }
        augment "/my-base:base-config/my-base:container1" {
            leaf new-leaf {
                type string;
            }
        }
    }
}
```
Here, `refine` disables configuration for `leaf1` and sets a default, while `augment` adds `new-leaf` under `container1`.

